        "title": "Bumang thanmei mai le muang",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Bumang thanmei mai le muang rui jailoumeipu,",
            "Guang Immanuel na guang dat ro;",
            "Numbang jingpui chang khou tat bam khou hei,",
            "Ganguang dat ro tingkau ganphiuGan gailiangmei pu rui.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He kau ganphiu (2) gaimei,",
            "Kanloumeipu le guang dailiangmei pu nang e;",
            "Rianramei rui rih kum ma dai guang pu sini,",
            "Ringmei Raguang khou tingsangjang bam ni.",
            "",
            "2. Nthukpui changmun kai kham lanlou pui kan khou,",
            "Kachak namdai gaimei khou gut ni,",
            "Pap jang khou rui rianra loumei guai 7#@,",
            "Katik gun daimei ramGuang tang pukhou puang lou puni.",
            "",
            "3. Lujiu Nah daimei neikei dat mak pui ram khou,",
            "Jianmei nun rui kandih ning dat mak;",
            "Laujiu Nah tikgun daimei thuan ku o,",
            "Ringmei thingbang lim khou,",
            "Nphuanmei phei banna bamni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
